    },
    {
      "id": "claim_682b07fd59524cba9392d79179a590bf",
      "statement": "ToolStrategy's handle_errors parameter controls automatic retry on validation failure: True (default) catches all errors with default message, False disables retry, string catches all with custom message, type/tuple catches specific exception types, and Callable allows custom per-exception retry logic. However, raw JSON schema dicts bypass validation, making handle_errors inert for dict schemas.",
      "evidence": [
        {
