        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_be90174cf8e840b69c4e364b9b7d51f6",
      "statement": "Schema kind classification distinguishes Pydantic, dataclass, TypedDict, and JSON schema variants. Pydantic, dataclass, and TypedDict schemas are validated via TypeAdapter during parsing; JSON schema dicts return parsed data as-is without validation. Union types are decomposed into variants, each normalized to a separate _SchemaSpec.",
